        <p>
            Project Nexus aims to revolutionize the quality of life for individuals with physical and sensory disabilities by developing a 
            unified, AI-driven smart environment. Current assistive technologies are often fragmented; our goal is to create a 
            seamless integration of IoT devices that respond to user intent, reducing the cognitive and physical load required for 
            daily living.
